    "name": "browser-windows",
    "author": "Ion - 7274",
    "description": "\n  A mod that allows you to create browser windows directly in the game.\nYou can interact with them, they process clicks, and you can watch videos, read articles, or just play games.\n[red[]]Warning! Be prepared for the fact that some sites may not be supported, and some games may not work due to capture features.\n[scarlet[]]Although the mod supports Android devices, there is no guarantee that they will work stably. A different API is used to support Android, as they do not support JCEF.\n[stat[]]The mod can support servers, but a plugin is required for this. Request it from Ion - 7274 (Discord: koctz34). (I will probably release the plugin file along with updates soon).\n[scarlet[]]This mod does not working on Linux and MacOS.[[]]\n  ",
